title: "human-synapse-bouton-lab: Formally Verified Human Synaptic Bouton Biophysics, Stochastic Nanocolumn Simulator, and 11-Discipline Open Hard Problems Framework"
abstract: "A full-stack, multi-language (TypeScript, Rust, Python, Lean 4.35.0) computational workbench, exact biophysical reference oracle, pre-registered Monte Carlo synaptic release simulator, and AMS-LaTeX white-paper suite covering human cortical synaptic bouton biophysics, microtubules, bioenergetics, DNA-origami metrology, and an 11-discipline map of open hard problems toward the consciousness frontier."
